Z||000000||85seNUT||02-18-2001||11:30 AM||||ok heres the thing.  I finnaly have some money saved up.  around 450 bucks.  I need to decide what to get next on my car.  Should i get borla exuast? or should i go for the sprint headers(the black ones they sell on west coast fiero).?  I just need to know, before i get the headers should i get exuast?  because you know, work your way from the outside to the engine to relieve the backpresure instead of creating more?  thanks||||reg||1
